WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.944
Look at these pictures. What's going to happen?

2
00:00:05.394 --> 00:00:08.970
Look at the sky! Those clouds are very dark.

3
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.277
It's going to rain.

4
00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:18.264
Look at them! She has a white dress, and he has a ring.

5
00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:20.804
They're going to get married!

6
00:00:23.054 --> 00:00:26.908
Look at that little boy on his bike. Is he going to fall?

7
00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:31.074
No, he isn't. His dad is helping him.

8
00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:35.599
And my dog is very hungry.

9
00:00:36.049 --> 00:00:39.114
He's going to eat everything in his bowl!

10
00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:45.311
Oh, no! The train is going to leave. Run!

11
00:00:45.761 --> 00:00:49.616
And you? What's going to happen in your life this year?

